@startuml
' Sequence: every request of a logged-in browser, and log out - Inventory & POS System v0.20.4 (report, Lecture 5; redrawn 2026-10-12)
' Edit: paste into draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > PlantUML) or planttext.com
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E6F1EE
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ActorBorderColor Black
  ActorBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
skinparam swimlaneWidth same
hide circle

actor User
participant "Browser\n(cookie: token)" as UI
participant "load_user()\n(app.py)" as C
database "login_session table" as DB
User -> UI : opens any page
UI -> C : request + cookie (user id, login token)
C -> DB : find the row with this token
alt no row (logged out, password changed, or a copied / forged cookie)
  C -> UI : forget the login and the basket
  C --> UI : redirect to the log-in page
else last seen more than 8 hours ago
  C -> DB : DELETE the row
  C --> UI : forget login and basket, log-in page
else fine
  C -> DB : last seen = now (at most once a minute)
  C --> UI : the page
end
User -> UI : Log out
UI -> C : POST /logout (CSRF)
C -> DB : DELETE this browser's row only
C --> UI : session cleared (basket too), home page
note right of DB
  Other tills logged in with the same
  account keep their own rows.
end note
@enduml
